#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:5
#: f48e0071e301452da4b888b075eac515
msgid "Using the Command Line Interface to Configure Copter"
msgstr "使用命令行界面配置 Copter"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:9
#: 5f905ed78f5f4fc894fd6ba9fbda8c3b
msgid ""
"The CLI is being phased out on all platforms. The features were massively "
"cut down with AC3.1.5 and then it was removed for the APM2 completely anyway"
" with AC3.2. All CLI functions are now available via regular MAVLink "
"commands in the GCSs. This article has been moved to the dev wiki and may be"
" considered deprecated."
msgstr ""
"CLI 正在所有平台上逐步淘汰。其功能在 AC3.1.5 中被大幅削减，在 AC3.2 中又彻底从 APM2 上移除。所有 CLI "
"功能现在可通过地面站中的常规 MAVLink 命令使用。本文已移至开发 wiki，可视为已废弃。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:15
#: 4ec5956bdd4e45df833161cfdc4e34a3
msgid ""
"You don't need to use the Mission Planner to set up Copter (and there are "
"some advanced configuration options not covered by the Mission Planner). You"
" can also use APM's built-in Command Line Interpreter (CLI) over a serial "
"terminal, which will work on any computer and operating system. It is only "
"available via the USB cable; it cannot be used via a Xbee/3DR wireless "
"connection."
msgstr ""
"您无需使用 Mission Planner 来设置 Copter（并且有一些高级配置选项 Mission Planner "
"不涵盖）。您也可以通过串口终端使用 APM 内置的命令行解释器（CLI），该功能在任何计算机和操作系统上均可使用。但它只能通过 USB 线使用，不能通过"
" Xbee/3DR 无线连接使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:22
#: 1c387e612080437a913d5038dbf769eb
msgid ""
"You will also need to use the CLI for such functions as assigning your "
"preferred flight modes to your RC transmitter's toggle switches. See the "
"menu descriptions below for instructions."
msgstr "您还需要使用 CLI 进行某些功能操作，例如将首选飞行模式分配给遥控器的拨动开关。有关说明，请参阅下面的菜单描述。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:26
#: 9286c47c02844593b1ed13bb361aa455
msgid ""
"You can enter the CLI by hitting \"Enter\" three times in the Mission "
"Planner Terminal screen."
msgstr "您可以通过在 Mission Planner 终端界面连续按三次「Enter」进入 CLI。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:29
#: e6f3966e3a98425890ed5ccc4bd36f51
msgid ""
"When you open it, it will look like this (with a more recent version number "
"of the software displayed):"
msgstr "打开后，它将如下所示（显示更新版本号的软件）："

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:35
#: f8ffbc8987314e84b9dbf62c32685ea8
msgid ""
"If you're not using Windows, you can also use the Serial Monitor built into "
"Arduino (remember to select the right baud rate and enable CRs as shown "
"here):"
msgstr "如果您不使用 Windows，也可以使用 Arduino 内置的串口监视器（请记住选择正确的波特率并启用 CR，如图所示）："

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:42
#: 3bd19e64ad79447d8d8da3a369ffe512
msgid ""
"Once you are in the CLI, you can type \"help\" at any menu and get a full "
"list of available commands."
msgstr "进入 CLI 后，您可以在任何菜单中输入「help」获取可用命令的完整列表。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:45
#: b37f7905c81c417a881b58ba356c8d52
msgid "There are three top-level menus: Setup, Test and Logs."
msgstr "有三个顶级菜单：Setup、Test 和 Logs。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:50
#: 61a17740be8845b79487118150795fc7
msgid ""
"Each has sub-menus, whose command can also be seen by typing \"help\" when "
"you are in that section."
msgstr "每个菜单都有子菜单，在该部分输入「help」也可查看其命令。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:54
#: 0c856af5c97a45508e6e528ddf179210
msgid "Setup Menu"
msgstr "Setup 菜单"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:59
#: 8b55a157b15c4ab4b03bbd78a51d88f3
msgid ""
"CLI interactive setup - You must go through each item and set the values to "
"match your hardware"
msgstr "CLI 交互式设置——您必须逐项检查并设置与您硬件匹配的数值"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:63
#: 837ccabf96574bb7967fb1c181739908
msgid "\"setup\" menu:commands:"
msgstr "「setup」菜单命令："

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:65
#: 890ba73bbf764ee281bfa9ce276f3230
msgid ""
"**erase**: When installing ACM for the first time, run this to erase bad "
"values from EEPROM -- just in case!"
msgstr "**erase**：首次安装 ACM 时，运行此命令清除 EEPROM 中的错误数值——以防万一！"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:67
#: 5bf192da8fda403abd81ed266ed89683
msgid "**reset**: Performs factory reset and initialization of EEPROM values"
msgstr "**reset**：执行工厂重置并初始化 EEPROM 数值"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:68
#: 7097bf5a225c408386f1a73e50d34145
msgid ""
"**radio**: Records the limits of ALL radio channels - very important!!!"
msgstr "**radio**：记录所有遥控通道的限值——非常重要！！！"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:70
#: 36a0b60d6e604bf2a641c331bc016d87
msgid ""
"**motors**: Interactive setup of your ESC and motors. Enter this mode, then "
"plug-in battery, move your RC transmitter's pitch/roll sticks in each "
"direction to make the prop in that direction spin (so moving the stick up "
"will make the front rotor spin on a quad, and moving it right will make the "
"right rotor spin). For copters with more than four motors, it will spin "
"groups of motors, with the one closest to the direction of the stick going "
"fastest."
msgstr ""
"**motors**：ESC "
"和电机的交互式设置。进入此模式后，接上电池，向各方向移动遥控器的俯仰/横滚摇杆，使该方向的螺旋桨旋转（即向上移动摇杆会使四旋翼前旋翼旋转，向右移动会使右旋翼旋转）。对于超过四个电机的多旋翼，将以组为单位旋转电机，最靠近摇杆方向的电机转速最快。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:77
#: c696541d869f4e749a19999e4708ce9b
msgid "**level**: Sets initial value of accelerometers - hold copter level"
msgstr "**level**：设置加速度计初始值——保持多旋翼水平"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:78
#: 7072889dc858424e8010fb7d0d27be52
msgid ""
"**modes**: Sets the flight modes assigned to each switch position (you have "
"5 available). Use your aileron/roll stick on your RC transmitter to scroll "
"through the options. Full right moves forward through the list; full left "
"moves back. Hit enter to save your settings and exit this mode."
msgstr ""
"**modes**：设置分配给每个开关位置的飞行模式（共 5 "
"个可用）。使用遥控器的副翼/横滚摇杆滚动选项。完全向右向前翻页，完全向左向后翻页。按回车键保存设置并退出此模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:83
#: 39e56d844f484f138190a03aad1914ba
msgid "**frame**: Sets your frame config: (x, +, v (Octo))"
msgstr "**frame**：设置机架配置：(x、+、v（Octo）)"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:84
#: 4ac01aac1a3a48c491a94a883f914bec
msgid ""
"**current**: Enables an AttoPilot current sensor: (on, off, milliamp hours)"
msgstr "**current**：启用 AttoPilot 电流传感器：（开启、关闭、毫安时）"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:86
#: dcfdb5f3aa2e487782791df2f4943dbc
msgid ""
"**sonar**: Enable sonar sensor. Sensor hooks to the \"pitot\" port which is "
"an analog input (on, off)."
msgstr "**sonar**：启用声纳传感器。传感器连接到「pitot」端口，该端口为模拟输入（开启、关闭）。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:88
#: b923ff6190494ee49da788822be9b82e
msgid "**compass**: Enables the compass (on, off)"
msgstr "**compass**：启用罗盘（开启、关闭）"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:89
#: f84bee6c05ec4b50bf899271068434ad
msgid ""
"**declination**: Sets your local declination value -- lookup online for "
"accuracy (decimal degrees)"
msgstr "**declination**：设置您当地的偏磁角值——在线查询以获取精确数值（十进制度）"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:91
#: 889c185cc9f74265a884e5e035349728
msgid "**show**: A formatted output of all the settings"
msgstr "**show**：格式化输出所有设置"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:94
#: 03b0254507064a0aaa8d55747fbcf795
msgid "Test Menu"
msgstr "Test 菜单"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:100
#: 8b7ce954a20f44d39e29a047230371d4
msgid "\"test\" menu commands:"
msgstr "「test」菜单命令："

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:102
#: cbf7c5c03b124240a05049128784d385
msgid "**pwm**: Outputs the pwm values of all 8 radio channels"
msgstr "**pwm**：输出所有 8 个遥控通道的 PWM 值"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:103
#: b8cd706ba9bf48a4ad937ad2f6345b91
msgid ""
"**radio**: Outputs the control values of all 8 radio channels in degrees x "
"100 or other value (see radio.pde)"
msgstr "**radio**：以度 x 100 或其他数值（见 radio.pde）输出所有 8 个遥控通道的控制值"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:105
#: b0065e91b3694a069c7e966c03f243fe
msgid "**failsafe**: (Not currently used)"
msgstr "**failsafe**：（当前未使用）"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:106
#: 8811b7ae5e7846bba62e519434dff323
msgid ""
"**stabilize**: Lets you test the stabilization with debugging output to the "
"terminal (may spin the props -- not recommended for flying)."
msgstr "**stabilize**：允许您测试稳定功能，并向终端输出调试信息（可能会转动螺旋桨——不建议飞行时使用）。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:108
#: 3e4a8cbfa9ec4a13be6d42a22077b48e
msgid ""
"**gps**: Outputs GPS data. Note: typically you must be outside to get GPS "
"lock. It can take two minutes or more to achieve lock at first power on."
msgstr "**gps**：输出 GPS 数据。注意：通常需要在户外才能获得 GPS 锁定。首次上电时可能需要两分钟或更长时间才能锁定。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:111
#: 264b6047b5254dd49fdb33945901d5b9
msgid "**adc**: Outputs raw adc values"
msgstr "**adc**：输出原始 ADC 值"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:112
#: 994c0e808ea8493686bbf366344daed7
msgid "**imu**: Outputs euler angles"
msgstr "**imu**：输出欧拉角"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:113
#: a35300c2f0944c3db9f217c546e45cb6
msgid "**battery**: Outputs voltage readings to analog in 0-3"
msgstr "**battery**：输出模拟输入 0-3 的电压读数"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:114
#: 47d916c84e704e3fa139dbb83b16bb99
msgid "**tune**: (Not currently used)"
msgstr "**tune**：（当前未使用）"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:115
#: c9b9a3627b4849a693b104cda765b4c5
msgid ""
"**current**: Outputs voltage and current from an AttoPilot current sensor. "
"Motors will spin, so disconnect your four-wire cable or take off your props!"
msgstr "**current**：输出 AttoPilot 电流传感器的电压和电流。电机将会旋转，请断开四线连接器或取下螺旋桨！"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:118
#: ad729366af5640d2abbf2337e4a44447
msgid "**relay**: Toggles the relay"
msgstr "**relay**：切换继电器"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:119
#: 09940e376b024a39ae86b2bd700c453d
msgid "**waypoints**: Dumps stored waypoint commands"
msgstr "**waypoints**：转储存储的航点命令"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:120
#: 1cf314e4d97e4982ae6e4d046b4020c6
msgid "**altitude**: Displays output from onboard barometric pressure sensor"
msgstr "**altitude**：显示板载气压传感器的输出"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:121
#: 0f53cdf2d8924ba69ab8ebd433f7689d
msgid "**sonar**: Displays output from sonar sensor (if attached and enabled)"
msgstr "**sonar**：显示声纳传感器的输出（如已连接并启用）"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:123
#: c8819a939e434150b944043e3c5c10ab
msgid "**compass**: Outputs compass angles in degrees (0 = north)"
msgstr "**compass**：以度输出罗盘角度（0 = 北）"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:124
#: 6c064662a2484a00920b2a380e8961fc
msgid "**xbee**: Outputs an XBEE sequence used for range testing"
msgstr "**xbee**：输出用于距离测试的 XBEE 序列"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:125
#: aed18903ca384e9eaa9117269f5a6a4a
msgid "**eedump**: Raw output of bytes in EEPROM"
msgstr "**eedump**：原始输出 EEPROM 中的字节"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:126
#: f6e71f213288443ba672d45d79deff6b
msgid "**rawgps**: Outputs raw, unparsed GPS data"
msgstr "**rawgps**：输出原始未解析的 GPS 数据"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:127
#: 8864c0bb6abb471285b54da56ba215e5
msgid ""
"**mission**: Writes a default mission to EEPROM (null, 'wp'). Choosing 'wp' "
"option will send the copter 15 meters North and back again."
msgstr "**mission**：向 EEPROM 写入默认任务（null、「wp」）。选择「wp」选项将使多旋翼向北飞行 15 米后返回。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:132
#: 254d82c889c7452c91f0b7c463523359
msgid "Logs Menu"
msgstr "Logs 菜单"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:138
#: b1db61298b464a3bbb7701149f6dd5d1
msgid "\"logs\" menu commands:"
msgstr "「logs」菜单命令："

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:140
#: e8291290d919412d910f91ba45eda904
msgid "Datalogging"
msgstr "数据日志"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:142
#: 4aa42a203fc94490ba62c7b4cb9c92bd
msgid ""
"You can use the on-board 16Mb datalogging memory to record information about"
" your flight and the APM’s performance."
msgstr "您可以使用板载 16Mb 数据日志存储器记录飞行信息和 APM 的性能数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:145
#: 2fee9b9bb5eb4d918ff901bc98cd638f
msgid ""
"Please note that before using the logging for the first time you must "
"\"erase\" the logs using the CLI (see below). If you do not take this step "
"then you will likely see a lot of invalid logs."
msgstr "请注意，首次使用日志记录前，您必须使用 CLI「erase」日志（见下文）。如果不执行此步骤，您可能会看到大量无效日志。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:149
#: 62f908d34d3a450aae76aa2a4732a463
msgid ""
"Normally, the slider switch on the IMU shield should be towards the inside "
"of the board, which is data logging/flight mode. But if you boot up with it "
"towards the edge of the board, it will go into the CLI mode. Using the "
"Arduino IDE serial monitor, you can type \"logs\" to manage and read your "
"log files:"
msgstr ""
"通常，IMU 屏蔽板上的拨动开关应朝向板内侧，即数据日志/飞行模式。但如果启动时开关朝向板边缘，则进入 CLI 模式。使用 Arduino IDE "
"串口监视器，您可以输入「logs」来管理和读取日志文件："

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:156
#: 37fe0ba15df34a03a11c9d3d4c56bb85
msgid "Reading and analyzing logs with the Mission Planner"
msgstr "使用 Mission Planner 读取和分析日志"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:158
#: f6032b7c37b34a289ef585979738bdcf
msgid ""
"The easiest way to download and analyze your log files is with the Mission "
"Planner, which will allow you to graph data, generate KML files for Google "
"Earth and otherwise manage the data flexibly."
msgstr ""
"下载和分析日志文件最简单的方法是使用 Mission Planner，它允许您绘制数据图表、生成 Google Earth 的 KML "
"文件，以及灵活管理数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:163
#: 6cd91214db4c44f3b981fb8a33e22eb0
msgid "Reading logs through the CLI"
msgstr "通过 CLI 读取日志"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:165
#: 74d19790ec1a4af4909dd3590a8877ad
msgid ""
"You can also download data files with the CLI. Enter it by typing ``logs`` "
"in the CLI and hitting the enter key. Here are the available commands:"
msgstr "您也可以通过 CLI 下载数据文件。在 CLI 中输入 ``logs`` 并按回车键进入。以下是可用命令："

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:169
#: fc9aea045c4948eeb61b93bbfc3b12ed
msgid "**\"dump *n*\"**: Dump log number *n*."
msgstr "**「dump *n*」**：转储编号为 *n* 的日志。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:170
#: d6b7c0b5cb1049969fea6bfbb16fa92f
msgid "**\"dump 0\"**: Dump and erase all logs."
msgstr "**「dump 0」**：转储并清除所有日志。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:171
#: b5b8020516484f28bfa12e1a2f89a5c9
msgid "**\"erase\"**: Erase all logs."
msgstr "**「erase」**：清除所有日志。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:172
#: 5cab73a786eb413b8d829f8a463c6040
msgid ""
"**\"enable *name*\"**: Enable logging *name*. Use \"all\" to enable "
"everything."
msgstr "**「enable *name*」**：启用名为 *name* 的日志记录。使用「all」启用所有内容。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:174
#: 36b34e12661b4fe2a91e71b0e7b7ffd2
msgid ""
"**\"disable *name*\"**: Disable logging *name*. Use \"all\" to disable "
"everything."
msgstr "**「disable *name*」**：禁用名为 *name* 的日志记录。使用「all」禁用所有内容。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:177
#: 112388f153374e45b5614716d7584642
